@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title SB-M15 — Effective policy, file admission and restricted evidence
actor "Actor in the relevant authority context" as U
participant "Effective file policy" as P
participant "Protected file resource" as F
participant "Restricted operational evidence" as E
U -> P : Request one intended policy / admission / evidence action
P -> P : Evaluate current action-specific authority
alt Denied
 P --> U : Denied; no protected action / evidence disclosure
else Permitted requested operation
 alt Authorized policy change
  U -> P : Supply intended policy change
  P -> P : Validate applicable measured envelope / effective rules
  P --> U : Actual effective or unapplied / failed result
 else Authorized file admission
  U -> F : Supply intended file and resource context
  F -> P : Evaluate format / size / quota / applicable references
  P --> F : Permitted admission or rejection
  alt Admission permitted
   F -> F : Validate / process and retain only permitted association
   F --> U : Actual available / partial / failed processing result
  else Admission rejected
   F --> U : Rejected; no usable-admission claim
  end
 else Inspect permitted operation evidence
  U -> E : Request specific resource / operation evidence
  E -> E : Evaluate evidence visibility and secret protection
  E --> U : Only permitted actual bounded evidence / denial
 end
end
note over P,E
These are separate requested goals, not a mandatory chain.
No automatic history deletion, blanket admin grant or false reclamation.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
